    <span class="eyebrow">API CONTRACT</span><h1>PeopleOps API</h1>
    <p>The application exposes a documented JSON API backed by the same embedded SQLite database used by the server-rendered interface.</p>
    <div class="endpoint-grid">
      <article><span>GET</span><code>/api/employees</code><p>Paginated directory with search, filters, sorting, and role-aware fields.</p></article>
      <article><span>PATCH</span><code>/api/employees/:id</code><p>Optimistic-concurrency employee updates for managers and admins.</p></article>
      <article><span>GET</span><code>/api/employees/:id/timeline</code><p>Structured employee lifecycle history.</p></article>
      <article><span>GET / POST</span><code>/api/employees/:id/tasks</code><p>Onboarding and offboarding workflow tasks.</p></article>
      <article><span>GET</span><code>/api/org</code><p>Reporting relationships and team structure.</p></article>
      <article><span>GET</span><code>/api/analytics</code><p>Operational workforce aggregates.</p></article>
    </div>
